10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Upgraded is a 2024 American romantic comedy film directed by Carlson Young and starring Camila
Mendes, Archie Renaux, Thomas Kretschmann, Grégory Montel, Lena Olin and Marisa Tomei.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
The film is a modern-day retelling of the classic fairytale "Cinderella" and focuses on Ana Santos, an ignored-but-ambitious intern in the
New York art world whose life and career change when by happenstance she is upgraded to first class on a flight to London.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It was released on Amazon Prime Video on February 9, 2024.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The film explores themes of new york city, london, england,
mistaken identity, life's dream, falling in love.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
